sue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nmaster, but also reproduced in earlier 4.x versions. I initially discovered this while working on a project with the latests 4.7 stable release\n\n### System information\n\nwin 10, forward+/mobile, dx12, gtx5080\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling buffer_clear with a p_offset that is not a multiple of 16 the DX12 rendering driver just crashes. On vulkan anything that is a multiple of 4 works fine.\n\nAccording to git blame the code responsible for this bug has existed for at least for 10 months already.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the project, ensure it is using DX12 and run the scene.\nIf the renderer is switched to vulkan or the offset parameter of the script is changed to 16 the game should stop crashing and print a success message to the console.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n[buffer_clear.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32533711/buffer_clear.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gi